{"schema":"rebang.page/1","channel":"finance","page":5,"pages":30,"total":875,"has_more":true,"items":[{"id":"pelosi3:30430","kind":"news","channel":"finance","source_id":"pelosi3","source_name":"敏感经济信息分享","title":"据悉SpaceX和特斯拉委派五名董事负责合并谈判","summary":"据英国金融时报援引知情人士的话报道，马斯克旗下的两家上市公司已任命五名董事（其中三人来自特斯拉，两人来自SpaceX）以指导负责合并谈判的两个特别委员会。这些董事包括来自SpaceX的罗洛夫·博塔（Roelof Botha）和兰迪·格莱恩（Randy Glein），以及来自特斯拉的罗宾·登霍尔姆（Robyn Denholm）、凯瑟琳·威尔逊-汤普森（Kathleen Wilson-Thompson）和杰克·哈通（Jack Hartung）。","url":"https://t.me/pelosi3/30430","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-24T13:26:43+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:10:54+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"据悉SpaceX和特斯拉委派五名董事负责合并谈判\n\n据英国金融时报援引知情人士的话报道，马斯克旗下的两家上市公司已任命五名董事（其中三人来自特斯拉，两人来自SpaceX）以指导负责合并谈判的两个特别委员会。这些董事包括来自SpaceX的罗洛夫·博塔（Roelof Botha）和兰迪·格莱恩（Randy Glein），以及来自特斯拉的罗宾·登霍尔姆（Robyn Denholm）、凯瑟琳·威尔逊-汤普森（Kathleen Wilson-Thompson）和杰克·哈通（Jack Hartung）。","tg":{"views":5440,"views_label":"5.44K","reactions":[{"emoji":"💩","count":8,"label":"8"},{"emoji":"❤","count":2,"label":"2"},{"emoji":"👍","count":2,"label":"2"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:06:44+08:00"}},{"id":"TimeHorizonX:2006","kind":"news","channel":"finance","source_id":"TimeHorizonX","source_name":"Time经济观察","title":"居民贷款四大分项只剩中长期经营贷款一项还在增长。","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/TimeHorizonX/2006","image":{"url":"media/TimeHorizonX/2006_1.webp","width":450,"height":800},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:53:48+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:10:54+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"居民贷款四大分项只剩中长期经营贷款一项还在增长。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/LeSI00Ro2dJQNyLdHdOcSczzbpcLIAoDxz-vtFOkS4lNPUF3mrYvGlm8RTlXN3J5cXgHE6V99XLbc8486EaavICRD6WyOrfEuQKhI500JeUjc2TPTLKC80hCaaSXlvdWQpJFrkPHmGAhGpCLLv72xRk1DdFfuYFFXKNjaY1xhBhZ73Ydtl6iPES08eYKOo08OwUjLGB1VMRINpo51-p1LHESjoWnckueLH2FXBtfoi1sF43OI4kgz_VCmJt8ejpKchvxjoJQN_X05YWXqfO5m0dHYze3ZeeEtrt3Q0uZzHZCg8rrBsAchBevFwM0pByFbewzRAeJmGuVgkK8Gf8l4A.jpg"}],"views":2310,"views_label":"2.31K","reactions":[{"emoji"